id: greedy-rabbit
name: Greedy Rabbit
order: 1
category: body
# "[Feline Build]": it replaces that Secondary Racial Trait - which, the table's.
importance: secondary
# (1) Bestial Build and Land-Based Beast, as it is gained - in the Other Traits list, gone with it.
grantsOther: bestial
grantsOtherCount: 2
grantsOtherFrom: bestial-build, land-based-beast
description: >
  Instead of taking the physical form of a cat, you more closely resemble a rabbit.
text: >
  Greedy Rabbit (Body) [Feline Build]: Instead of taking the physical form of a cat, you more closely resemble a rabbit.
  (1)-[Passive]: At Character Creation, gain the Bestial Build and Land-Based Beast Bestial Traits.
  (2)-[Passive]: For every Integrated Majin-Dama you possess, increase your Maximum Life Points by 1 for each Power Level reached.
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase your Speed by 1(T) and Defense Value by 1(T) for each of your Active Integrated Majin-Damas.
  (4)-[Passive]: You may have 2 Active Integrated Majin-Damas (ignoring the maximum for Integrated Accessories). Apply the effects of any Active Integrated Majin-Dama you possess, ignoring Double-Dip.
  (5)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: Regain 2(bT) Ki Points for every Integrated Majin-Dama you possess (max. 10(bT)).
  (6)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: Target an Opponent. Make a Clash (Cognitive/Morale) against that Opponent. If you win, they enter the Sleeping Combat Condition.

---

# (4) Read where it is held (integrated.mjs greedyDama): two Majin-Damas Active, beside the one other Accessory, and each one's
# effects (gear.mjs accessoriesInEffect).
# (6) A Maneuver of its own - maneuvers/greedy-rabbit-sixth-effect.dbu, in the list while this is had.
[passive]
# (2) "Even if they are Inactive", as Neko Majin-Dama's x.
life.perLevel += majinDama.integrated;
# (3)
speed.all += majinDama.active * 1(T);
defenseValue += majinDama.active * 1(T);

# (5) Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/start-of-turn, effect 5]
requires majinDama.integrated > 0;
ki.value += min(majinDama.integrated, 5) * 2(bT);
